# ==================================================
# Quantumult X - Overseas AI Rules
# https://github.com/storevip/Quantumult-X-Rules
#
# Design goals:
# - Overseas AI only; Mainland China AI services are intentionally excluded.
# - Prefer provider-owned domains and dedicated API/CDN endpoints.
# - Avoid broad shared services such as stripe.com, auth0.com, sentry.io,
#   intercom.io, storage.googleapis.com and api.cloudflare.com.
# - Rules include the AI policy for direct use; force-policy=AI is also supported.
# ==================================================

# --------------------
# OpenAI / ChatGPT / Codex / Sora
# --------------------
